        <div class="row pt-6 pb-6">
          <div class="col-12">
            <h2 class="mb-6">1. A Proposal for Porsche Cars Australia Commerce Platform Transformation</h2>
            <video class="w-100" src="./assets/porsche-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" controls muted autoplay>Sorry, your browser doesn't support HTML5 video tag.</video>
          </div>
