        <div class="row pb-6">
          <div class="col-lg-8 col-12">
            <h4 class="text-base font-weight-bold mb-0">Customer Acquisition – Porsche Gear for the Many Journeys</h4>
            <p>Diversify the acquisition marketing portfolio and take advantage of the new website. 70% of media should be focused on building the consumer base within the first 12 months after the new website’s launch.</p>
            <h5 class="text-base mb-0">FB/IG Paid Media:</h5>
            <ul>
              <li>Target Porsche audiences that have affinities for luxury and refined products.</li>
              <li>Utilize all ad formats while leaning into carousels to showcase all the great gear that Porsche has available.</li>
            </ul>
            <h5 class="text-base mb-0">Paid Search:</h5>
            <ul>
              <li>Capture Porsche-related searches, especially for apparel/gear/products, and land the customer onto enhanced, CX improved category pages. Help the consumer with targeted experiences.</li>
            </ul>
            <h5 class="text-base mb-0">Performance Marketing Content:</h5>
            <ul>
              <li>Improve data feed/shopping ad programs through a clean, accurate feed.</li>
              <ul>
                <li>A well-built feed can support FB DBA ads and Pmax Google Shopping ads.</li>
              </ul>
              <li>Leverage permission-based UGC within ads.</li>
            </ul>
            <h5 class="text-base mb-0">Partnership/affiliate platform:</h5>
            <ul>
              <li>Utilize a Gen3 platform to seamlessly acquire and partner with influencers.</li>
              <ul>
                <li>RC has direct connections with Impact or Partnerize.</li>
              </ul>
            </ul>
            <p>Partner with bid management affiliates that focus on 2nd tier platforms on a CPA basis.</p>
            <h4 class="text-base font-weight-bold mb-0">Customer Retention – Enjoy the Journey</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Capture customer data along the journey:</li>
              <ul>
                <li>Push notifications to easily capture consumer interest and establish communication.</li>
                <li>Assure the email subscription field is easily found and visible on the new website.</li>
                <ul>
                  <li>Create a value purpose landing page, such as hubspot</li>
                </ul>
              </ul>
              <li>Programatic Display</li>
              <ul>
                <li>Continue the conversation over visuals through retargeting and trigger display campaigns.</li>
              </ul>
              <li>Walking advertisements for Porsche merchandise:</li>
              <ul>
                <li>Leverage UGC on the website.</li>
                <li>apture reviews per key products. Reviews are a top 3 reason why consumers purchase a product.</li>
              </ul>
              <li>Performance Marketing Content:</li>
              <ul>
                <li>Beyond the homepage, assure the collection and key landing pages showcase content, both lifestyle and copy.</li>
              </ul>
              <li>Social:</li>
              <ul>
                <li>Maintain an active presence on TikTok, IG, and YouTube.</li>
                <li> Either via the main Porsche social accounts or via a page specific to the Porsche lifestyle product.</li>
              </ul>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
